@Life Hints
@<Hotel Rule:> Sleeping the night fully recovers both HP and PP.
@<Recovery Rule:> Continuing from a lost battle restores you with full HP but 0 PP.
@Half of the money you were carrying on hand is also lost.[13][02]

@Convenience Hints
@<ATM Rule:> ATMs can be used to withdraw money.
@An ATM can always be found in hotels, stores, and train stations. 
@<Phone Rule:> Telephones can be used to record your progress.
@Black phones are free to use. Green payphones cost $1.
@Telephones can also be found anywhere an ATM is available.[13][02]

